        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The outcome of the Keystone Pipeline vote will reveal the actual extent of Republican influence in Washington.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Filibuster-proof and veto-proof status are necessary indicators of true legislative dominance.",
